Package: ipad-manager
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: IPAd Manager Team
Depends: libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64, libcurl4 | libcurl4t64, libssl3 | libssl3t64, libpcsclite1 | libpcsclite1t64, libpaho-mqtt1.3
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: IPAd Manager with private ABI-locked IPAd SDK
 Provides the GTK Manager, private libipa.so, health checks, diagnostics,
 configuration, and desktop integration for IPAd deployments.
